cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Rajkot Price Index or its methods, please cite this repository."
title: "Rajkot Price Index (RPI): an independent web-scraped consumer price index for Rajkot, Gujarat"
abstract: >-
  A daily-updating consumer price index for Rajkot (Gujarat, India), base 2025-01 = 100, built from web-scraped
  prices, administered tariffs and official MoSPI item indices, and validated month-on-month against MoSPI's
  Gujarat-urban CPI. The repository publishes the index series, the weights recovered from MoSPI's published index
  tree, the pseudo-real-time evaluation harness, and the uncertainty decomposition.
authors:
  - alias: Nityahapani
    name: "Nityahapani"
    website: "https://github.com/Nityahapani"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nityahapani/rpi"
keywords:
  - consumer price index
  - nowcasting
  - web scraping
  - India
  - Gujarat
  - Rajkot
  - seasonal adjustment
  - forecast evaluation
